-- check/bad: §10.4. A rigid variable carries exactly the constraints its
-- `where` clause declares (§6.2 Rule U2), and the body asks for one it does
-- not. The message points at the CALL that needs the method — the answer to
-- report 18 §2.4 — and quotes the clause that would fix it.
pub twice : a, Int -> a
twice x factor = x.scale factor
